---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { REFUND_ADDRESS, REMOVAL_ADDRESS } from "../lib/launch.ts";
---

<Base>
  <div class="wrap section-y">
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <h1 class="page-title text-ink mb-4">Refunds</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">Effective date: 25 September 2026.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
        The Rupee Fund is a FOSS United community initiative run by community members. We adopt the
        donation-refund principles in the <a
          href="https://fossunited.org/refund-transfer-policy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-link">FOSS United refund and transfer policy</a
        >, as reviewed on 7 September 2026: submit claims promptly, provide transaction details, and
        review donations made in error on an individual basis. The local rules below apply to this
        fund and take precedence where the source differs. Ticket-transfer rules do not apply. Later
        changes to the source do not change this policy automatically.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-ink mt-10 mb-3">Before launch</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
        This site takes no payments at this stage. Joining the launch notification list does not
        charge you or create a payment obligation. We will publish the payment recipient, refund
        contact, claim period, and recurring-payment cancellation process before contributions open.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl text-ink mt-10 mb-3">Donations made to the Foundation</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
        If you donated directly to FOSS United Foundation, its policy asks you to email{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${REFUND_ADDRESS}`} class="inline-link">{REFUND_ADDRESS}</a> within 15 days.
        That process concerns donations to the Foundation. It does not identify the Foundation as the
        recipient or refund decision-maker for future contributions to The Rupee Fund.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl text-ink mt-10 mb-3">Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-2">
        For questions about The Rupee Fund, send an email to <a
          href={`mailto:${REMOVAL_ADDRESS}`}
          class="inline-link">{REMOVAL_ADDRESS}</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
